HB0175 Wyoming veterans museum capital construction.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Harshman, Eklund and Washut and
Senator(s) Barlow and Boner
AN ACT relating to veterans; authorizing renovation of the Wyoming veterans'
memorial museum; creating a task force; requiring reporting; providing
appropriations; and providing for an effective date.
